# Super-Board AI Guard (Permanent)

Enforce on every UI/domain edit in this repository.

## RULE 1 — STRICT 4-STATE UI
- Surfaces must cover Loading, Empty, Active, Error via enterprise primitives.
- Never leave primary interactions as unstyled HTML.

## RULE 2 — DOMAIN ISOLATION
- No new Shift UI/imports inside Planner pages/components (teal stays teal).
- No Planner mega-UI embedded in Shift Search / Shift chrome (green stays green).
- Career remains separate from Shift and Planner state.

## RULE 3 — DEBUG TEXT PURGE + DEV SANDBOX
- Ban smashed production copy (`Gig HomeKPIs`, etc.).
- DEV overlays must use `data-audit-sandbox="dev"` / `.wm-dev-audit-sandbox` or full enterprise classes.

## RULE 4 — AUTONOMOUS AUDIT
- Before completing a UI refactor, run:
  `npx playwright test --project=chromium tests/e2e/visual-inspection-planner-home.spec.ts`
- Critical/high inspector findings = not done.
- Inspector: `tests/e2e/helpers/visual-assertion-inspector.ts`

