# Universal Visual Inspection Standards

## VIS-1 Geometry + STRICT string smash
- Use `getBoundingClientRect()`; overlap or missing gap = CRITICAL.
- Contiguous label+description join (`Gig HomeKPIs`, etc.) is ALWAYS CRITICAL — never soften to INFO.

## VIS-2 Enterprise primitives mandatory
- Interactive / primary surfaces need `wm-planner-*` / `wm-ent-*` / domain shell classes.
- Raw unstyled controls never pass (HIGH/MEDIUM).

## VIS-3 Dev noise purge
- Debug text leaks = HIGH.
- Sandbox DEV widgets so they cannot corrupt production audits.

## VIS-4 4-state probe
- Prefer enterprise Loading/Empty/Active/Error primitives; raw fallbacks = HIGH.
